{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09061","headline":"寄职方刘郎中 · 韦应物","name":"寄职方刘郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相闻二十载，不得展平生。\n一夕南宫遇，聊用写中情。\n端服光朝次，羣烈慕英声。\n归来坐粉闱，挥笔乃纵横。\n始陪文翰游，欢燕难久幷。\n予因谬忝出，君爲沈疾婴。\n别离寒暑过，荏苒春草生。\n故园兹日隔，新禽池上鸣。\n郡中永无事，归思徒自盈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09061.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09061","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}